<p>
  Shared state is a <code>Y.Map</code> of shape records (x, y, text, color).
  Double-click to add a note, drag to move, type to edit. Real canvas tools like
  tldraw and Excalidraw keep their document as a record store and bind it to a
  <code>Y.Map</code> the same way, so this provider drops under them unchanged.
</p>
